			<li><strong>One account:</strong> you agree to maintain only one account and to provide accurate information.</li>
			<li><strong>Responsibility for credentials:</strong> you are responsible for safeguarding your login and for all activity under your account. Notify us promptly if you suspect any unauthorized use.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section id="acceptable-use">
		<h2>4. Acceptable Use and Prohibited Conduct</h2>
		<p>You agree to use the Service lawfully and responsibly. You must not:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Upload, distribute, or transmit malicious code, malware, or any harmful content;</li>
			<li>Send spam or engage in unsolicited or abusive communications through the Service;</li>
			<li>Scrape, crawl, harvest, data-mine, or use automated means to extract content or data from the Service without our prior written permission;</li>
			<li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the Service, other users' accounts, or our systems, or otherwise interfere with or disrupt the Service;</li>
			<li>Submit content that infringes the intellectual property or other rights of any third party, or that is unlawful, harmful, deceptive, or fraudulent;</li>
			<li>Misrepresent your identity or impersonate any person or entity.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>We may remove content and suspend or terminate access for conduct that violates these Terms.</p>
	</section>

	<section id="submissions">
		<h2>5. User Submissions</h2>
		<p>
			If you submit a prompt or other content to the Service, you represent that you have the right
			to do so and grant Free Prompt Base a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license to host,
			display, reproduce, adapt, and distribute that content as part of the Service. We may review,
			edit, reject, or remove submissions at our discretion, and we are not obligated to publish any
			submission.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section id="ip">
		<h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Prompts:</strong> prompts on the Service are provided for personal and commercial use. When you use prompts with third-party AI tools, you are responsible for complying with the licenses, terms, and copyright and AI-content rules that apply in your jurisdiction and to the tools you use.</li>
			<li><strong>Our content and branding:</strong> the Service, including its design, organization, text, logos, name, and other branding, is owned by Free Prompt Base or its licensors and is protected by intellectual property laws. Except for the permitted use of prompts described above, you may not copy, reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from the Service without our prior written permission. Linking to individual prompts is always welcome.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section id="ai-tools">
