			uninterrupted, error-free, or secure, or that any content or prompt will produce a particular
			result.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section id="liability">
		<h2>10. Limitation of Liability</h2>
		<p class="legal-fineprint">
			To the maximum extent permitted by law, Free Prompt Base and its operator will not be liable for
			any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any loss of data,
			profits, or goodwill, arising out of or relating to your use of (or inability to use) the
			Service or any third-party AI tools, whether based on warranty, contract, tort, or any other
			legal theory, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.
		</p>
		<p>Some jurisdictions do not allow certain limitations of liability, so some of the above may not apply to you.</p>
	</section>

	<section id="termination">
		<h2>11. Termination</h2>
